Package: quick.lctm.escc
Type: Package
Title: Latent Class Trajectory Modeling for 7 Nutritional Markers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Anonymous", family = "Package", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "package@example.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-6575-5277"))
Description: Fits Bayesian latent class trajectory models (LCTM) on 7 nutritional
    and inflammatory markers (ALB, TC, LYM, CRP, SMI, SFI, VFI) measured at
    multiple time points to classify oesophageal cancer patients into Resilient
    (RC) vs Vulnerable (VC) nutritional trajectory classes. Provides a 2-level input design: full 5-timepoint LCTM (L1) and partial 2-4 timepoint LCTM (L2, with MCMC imputation), using only the 7 nutritional and inflammatory markers (ALB, TC, LYM, CRP, SMI, SFI, VFI). Includes pre-trained v8 parameters for offline prediction without MCMC.
